p, but lacks reliability evidence, stress resilience, communication, and is not open to new ideas. D has problem solving, responsibility, concentration, but hot temper, arrogance, weak leadership, no decision quality evidence.\n\nThus C seems strongest on core safety criteria, with some concerns on communication and adaptability. B's concerns are also significant, plus lack of decision quality. So I think we should shift our vote to Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: mention that we now see that B lacks concrete decision quality, and that C has explicit decision quality and reliability, outweighing communication concerns. Also note that A and D have insufficient evidence.\n\nThus our public message: I agree with Agent 3 and Agent 1, shift to Candidate C. Provide reasoning.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
